invariant: INV-59
file: mldsa_poly.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh mldsa_ntt
reason: the inverse NTT no longer reduces its inputs first, so a sum of
  256 coefficients from all of int32_t overflows. The mldsa_ntt proof
  holds the transform free of overflow on every input, and its
  signed-overflow check fails.

--- old
    int32_t *w = p->coeffs;
    mld_poly_reduce(p);
    unsigned m = MLD_N;
--- new
    int32_t *w = p->coeffs;
    unsigned m = MLD_N;
